  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Adaptation and Resilience for Communities through Malawi humanitarian NGO Consortium</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will strengthen community-led resilience and anticipatory action in Nsanje, Chikwawa, and Phalombe to reduce the impact and cost of responding to climate-induced disasters. The action will scale community identified actions, early warning, cash support, and agricultural inputs. Coordination, protection, and accountability systems will enable an effective humanitarian response and reduce the impact of crises on the most vulnerable, including women and girls, in line with the UK Humanitarian Framework.</narrative>
  </description>
